  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"111\">🎮 Nintendo Switch incl. Dock, HDMI & Oplader | Gebruikt | €139.99</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"390\">Deze <strong data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"137\">Nintendo Switch</strong> is een veelzijdige spelconsole waarmee je zowel <strong data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"204\">thuis op de tv</strong> als <strong data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"221\">onderweg</strong> kunt gamen. De set wordt compleet geleverd met <strong data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"300\">dock, HDMI-kabel en oplader</strong> en is volledig getest. Ideaal voor casual én fanatieke gamers. Direct klaar voor gebruik.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"409\">Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<li data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"442\">\r\n<p data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"442\"><strong data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"424\">Product:</strong> Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"494\">\r\n<p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"494\"><strong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"454\">Merk:</strong> <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\">Nintendo</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"547\">\r\n<p data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"547\"><strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"507\">Opset:</strong> Console + Dock + HDMI-kabel + Oplader</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"596\">\r\n<p data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"596\"><strong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"562\">Gebruik:</strong> TV-modus, tafelmodus & handheld</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"638\">\r\n<p data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"638\"><strong data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"612\">Toestand:</strong> Gebruikt, volledig getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"653\">Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"833\">\r\n<li data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"681\">\r\n<p data-start=\"656\" data-end=\"681\">Speel thuis én onderweg</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"735\">\r\n<p data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"735\">Complete set inclusief alle benodigde accessoires</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"774\">\r\n<p data-start=\"738\" data-end=\"774\">Groot aanbod aan games beschikbaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"810\">\r\n<p data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"810\">Ideaal voor solo en multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"833\">\r\n<p data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"833\">Direct gebruiksklaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"844\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"857\"><strong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"857\">€ 139.99</strong></p>",
